  "final_message": "The bug was in [payments.collect](/tmp/bsvc-ijpsgix3/billing-service/billing/payments.py:9): when no payment method existed, it returned without recording a failed attempt. The fix sends that case through dunning, so it emits a payment-failed event, schedules retries, and moves the subscription to `past_due`.\n\nI added a lifecycle regression test and wrote [answer.json](/tmp/bsvc-ijpsgix3/billing-service/answer.json). The full test suite passes: **25 passed**.",
